 agent service errors\n\nThe orchestrator service is not properly starting up, leading to `ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED` errors when trying to generate blueprints. Additionally, the agent service is still encountering issues with Pinecone vector dimension mismatches.\n\nThis commit addresses the following:\n\n- **Orchestrator Startup:** Ensures the orchestrator service starts correctly and is accessible.\n- **Blueprint Generation:** Fixes the `ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED` error when calling the `/api/wizard/generate-blueprint` endpoint.\n- **Agent Service Pinecone Dimension:** Resolves the vector dimension mismatch error reported by the agent service when interacting with Pinecone.","tree":{"sha":"621e1e61695e5b2c62cedea368304170e95dca9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Emrash/genesis-spark-orchestra-28/git/trees/621e1e61695e5b2c62cedea368304170e95dca9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Emrash/genesis-spark-orchestra-28/git/commits/344e61264528c11b0e88ce08cc9206cadcae83cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/818760?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/lovable-dev","id":159125892,"login":"lovable-dev[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCXwRhA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lovable-dev%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url