as 100% integrado y responsivo\n- IP ::ffff:192.168.100.101 manejada correctamente","tree":{"sha":"ae342eaff85fb7076a0717626e44486902d538bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/git/trees/ae342eaff85fb7076a0717626e44486902d538bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/git/commits/f34798da929e47d47d6d7647387cf93f49798242","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commit/f34798da929e47d47d6d7647387cf93f49798242","node_id":"C_kwDOPSAzktoAKGYzNDc5OGRhOTI5ZTQ3ZDQ3ZDZkNzY0NzM4N2NmOTNmNDk3OTgyNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commit/952bfbc13c8ebe5686427aa968c53b37c077a128","sha":"952bfbc13c8ebe5686427aa968c53b37c077a128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commits/952bfbc13c8ebe5686427aa968c53b37c077a128"}],"sha":"f34798da929e47d47d6d7647387cf93f49798242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commits/f34798da929e47d47d6d7647387cf93f49798242"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commits/952bfbc13c8ebe5686427aa968c53b37c077a128/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-09T21:03:16Z","email":"jesanchez@DCTIC.GC","name":"Jefry Agustin Astacio Sanchez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-09T21:03:16Z","email":"jesanchez@DCTIC.GC","name":"Jefry Agustin Astacio Sanchez"},"message":" Fix: Update auth routes to match cleaned backend\n\n Updated apiConfig.ts:\n- Changed /auth/login  /admin-auth/login\n- Updated all auth endpoints to /admin-auth/*\n- Aligned with backend cleanup changes\n\n Frontend now properly connects to unified backend auth system","tree":{"sha":"c6b7863e42f4b3b0d321688be36ae465848a4728","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/git/trees/c6b7863e42f4b3b0d321688be36ae465848a4728"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/git/commits/952bfbc13c8ebe5686427aa968c53b37c077a128","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commit/952bfbc13c8ebe5686427aa968c53b37c077a128","node_id":"C_kwDOPSAzktoAKDk1MmJmYmMxM2M4ZWJlNTY4NjQyN2FhOTY4YzUzYjM3YzA3N2ExMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commit/be3a4c0009ecc8b09c1e67da196cdae970180d57","sha":"be3a4c0009ecc8b09c1e67da196cdae970180d57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commits/be3a4c0009ecc8b09c1e67da196cdae970180d57"}],"sha":"952bfbc13c8ebe5686427aa968c53b37c077a128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commits/952bfbc13c8ebe5686427aa968c53b37c077a128"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commits/be3a4c0009ecc8b09c1e67da196cdae970180d57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-09T18:54:09Z","email":"jesanchez@DCTIC.GC","name":"Jefry Agustin Astacio Sanchez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-09T18:54:09Z","email":"jesanchez@DCTIC.GC","name":"Jefry Agustin Astacio Sanchez"},"message":"feat: Dashboard integrado con analytics del backend y sistema de diseño mejorado\n\n DASHBOARD CON ANALYTICS REALES:\n- Integración completa con backend analytics (/analytics/stats/public)\n- Métricas en tiempo real: usuarios, eventos, imágenes\n- Indicador visual de conexión: '' CONECTADO AL BACKEND ''\n- Hook useAnalyticsSimple para fetch de datos reales\n- Actualización automática cada 10 minutos\n\n COMPONENTES DE ANALYTICS:\n- PieChart, BarChart, LineChart con diseño futurista\n- PerformanceMetrics para métricas del sistema\n- RecentActivityFeed para actividad reciente\n- Integración con tipos TypeScript del backend\n\n SERVICIOS Y CONEXIÓN:\n- analyticsService.ts conectado a backend real\n- Manejo robusto de errores y estados de carga\n- calculatePerformanceMetrics para métricas avanzadas\n- Configuración API unificada en apiConfig.ts\n\n SISTEMA DE DISEÑO UNIFICADO:\n- Migration completa a CSS variables dinámicas\n- Sistema de responsive design con clamp() y breakpoints\n- Tema cyberpunk/futurista consistente\n- Componentes ModernButton y Sidebar actualizados\n\n MEJORAS DE RENDIMIENTO:\n- Build exitoso sin errores TypeScript\n- Eliminación de imports y variables no utilizadas\n- Optimización de componentes y hooks\n- Documentación completa del sistema\n\n ANÁLISIS EXHAUSTIVO BACKEND:\n- Documentación completa del sistema de depósitos\n- Identificación de funcionalidades existentes y faltantes\n- Roadmap de mejoras para pagos móviles\n- Arquitectura dual: Payment System + Deposits\n\n RESULTADO:\n- Dashboard totalmente funcional con datos reales\n- Sistema de diseño 100% responsivo y dinámico\n- Conexión estable con backend analytics\n- Base sólida para futuras mejoras","tree":{"sha":"eec5e68c20c4f72bb473c110a1332d200cc68cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/git/trees/eec5e68c20c4f72bb473c110a1332d200cc68cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/git/commits/be3a4c0009ecc8b09c1e67da196cdae970180d57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commit/be3a4c0009ecc8b09c1e67da196cdae970180d57","node_id":"C_kwDOPSAzktoAKGJlM2E0YzAwMDllY2M4YjA5YzFlNjdkYTE5NmNkYWU5NzAxODBkNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commit/ac11ebd0ef8489b5f52543ec0b5b1d9c4548a022","sha":"ac11ebd0ef8489b5f52543ec0b5b1d9c4548a022","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MussikOn/APP_Mussikon_Admin_System/commits/ac11ebd0ef8489b5f52543ec0b5b1d9c4548a