site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/commits/85f93e4669dbb7dd0762347ee52482a24875b3e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:59:51Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:59:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): bump Angular to 22.2 and graphql-tools, resolve vulnerabilities (#207)\n\n## Summary\n\nResolves the open Dependabot alerts and the fixable `npm audit` findings. The @angular/router, piscina and @graphql-tools/utils advisories need newer minor/patch releases of exact-pinned dependencies.\n\n## Dependency bumps (exact pins kept)\n\n- @angular/animations, common, compiler, compiler-cli, core, elements, forms, localize, platform-browser, platform-browser-dynamic, router 22.1.6 → 22.2.1\n- @angular/build, @angular/cli 22.1.8 → 22.2.2\n- @graphql-tools/graphql-file-loader 8.1.18 → 8.1.22, @graphql-tools/load 8.1.15 → 8.1.19, @graphql-tools/merge 9.2.2 → 9.2.6, @graphql-tools/url-loader 9.1.6 → 9.1.12\n\n## Lockfile updates (bump and `npm audit fix`)\n\n- @angular/router 22.1.6 → 22.2.1\n- piscina 5.2.0 → 5.3.2 (via @angular/build 22.2.2)\n- @graphql-tools/utils 11.2.2 and 12.0.1 → 12.0.3\n- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.30.0 removed (@angular/cli 22.2.2 uses @modelcontextprotocol/server 2.3.1), dropping proxy-addr 2.0.7 and ip-address 10.7.0\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 → 1.2.2\n- fast-uri 3.1.7 → 3.1.8\n- brace-expansion 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Not fixable\n\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm): no patched version published yet; dev only\n\n## Verification\n\n`npm ci`, `npm install`, `npm run build` and `npm test` (26 test files) pass.\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP grzegorz.krajniak@sap.com\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"02f1bec7cf3f13e88238288df69ee07a071ed493","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/trees/02f1bec7cf3f13e88238288df69ee07a071ed493"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/commits/85f93e4669dbb7dd0762347ee52482a24875b3e4","verification":{"payload":"tree 02f1bec7cf3f13e88238288df69ee07a071ed493\nparent 859ae68072dfc59566809d3e6b478c5b0169c8bb\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1791363591 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791363591 +0400\n\nfix(deps): bump Angular to 22.2 and graphql-tools, resolve vulnerabilities (#207)\n\n## Summary\n\nResolves the open Dependabot alerts and the fixable `npm audit` findings. The @angular/router, piscina and @graphql-tools/utils advisories need newer minor/patch releases of exact-pinned dependencies.\n\n## Dependency bumps (exact pins kept)\n\n- @angular/animations, common, compiler, compiler-cli, core, elements, forms, localize, platform-browser, platform-browser-dynamic, router 22.1.6 → 22.2.1\n- @angular/build, @angular/cli 22.1.8 → 22.2.2\n- @graphql-tools/graphql-file-loader 8.1.18 → 8.1.22, @graphql-tools/load 8.1.15 → 8.1.19, @graphql-tools/merge 9.2.2 → 9.2.6, @graphql-tools/url-loader 9.1.6 → 9.1.12\n\n## Lockfile updates (bump and `npm audit fix`)\n\n- @angular/router 22.1.6 → 22.2.1\n- piscina 5.2.0 → 5.3.2 (via @angular/build 22.2.2)\n- @graphql-tools/utils 11.2.2 and 12.0.1 → 12.0.3\n- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.30.0 removed (@angular/cli 22.2.2 uses @modelcontextprotocol/server 2.3.1), dropping proxy-addr 2.0.7 and ip-address 10.7.0\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 → 1.2.2\n- fast-uri 3.1.7 → 3.1.8\n- brace-expansion 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Not fixable\n\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm): no patched version published yet; dev only\n\n## Verification\n\n`npm ci`, `npm install`, `npm run build` and `npm test` (26 test files) pass.\n\n