n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrw0iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKNUQACqi5F3AujG9WXUcGl/zTsWm\n5izHPcqRbQUNbVDhSnlclsdATZoZ2f07KF/ZoKn/JLq5HT1LiyHqzz/ER0z92TB7\nsnfDBNIK62swwvrtDvH1sdUFJpuNbUN4tKs6xFFOmPejK9EVLs8Yyk67Ex5yygsh\nWzCU/NDyT9w9xMSoLvZajYSPBoF36GXndZTnaxANJZmCD6H0oOmQT1tm+thMcZND\nEQq7pqMMS3Rx1rgPvcwZYhsgXGY19kNNLjkXQ8GeJxcGvzUa2yy3TtKJQHMb5g+f\npyRiSOlJNvarVdO8Asb4ZM5Ir5sSemC/eLUZlGEXvJip2naqazd+XZy4UMzHuyBj\nEYbI+88CnXX7okRJhppoOoylPib0uM3oFjcYfTbKsTwemDge353zfBbJRncv2Ggj\nIBcHCsG5dul658NwRg8IYYHvHdN3mgE5DLnpSnQfEd4af1b7hOjkhR5WE7WPRWaE\nB1jqX9IWMrC3hmXtL3yvJ/rsJurKac8eukac5E8ymztXERFeOv6JReWibk7VIJHH\n/P70ArKVusz5VaM0A+ZLTzlcKXhMZhh8PaUeGYE7JoOusbqkKq0AWzFP6wb0s87Z\nd5HA2HH375eyD+ZYtIIImjfjfBKQri5dXb/Su+jnxMaKQnM5EHX0fmx4aRPAb323\ncj/EnSZyW1vnc8CEGyp3\n=jf4W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T22:30:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/commit/006f363e27b8fe5d6fcdbd3dc64d5a6b58372c47","node_id":"C_kwDOPSEO2toAKDAwNmYzNjNlMjdiOGZlNWQ2ZmNkYmQzZGM2NGQ1YTZiNTgzNzJjNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/commit/5de352a7015f5a572b878b3e15bb2b2244708842","sha":"5de352a7015f5a572b878b3e15bb2b2244708842","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/commits/5de352a7015f5a572b878b3e15bb2b2244708842"}],"sha":"006f363e27b8fe5d6fcdbd3dc64d5a6b58372c47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/commits/006f363e27b8fe5d6fcdbd3dc64d5a6b58372c47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7794387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gkrajniak","id":7794387,"login":"gkrajniak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQzODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/commits/5de352a7015f5a572b878b3e15bb2b2244708842/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:37:37Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T07:37:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: simplify provider metadata model and make catalog filters dynamic (#202)\n\n* Adjust verification info\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor: simplify provider metadata model and make catalog filters dynamic\n\n## What changed\n- Folded the standalone `mainLink` field into `links[]`: a link is now marked\n  as the main one via `links[].main` instead of a separate field.\n- Removed the raw `labels` field; provider chips are now derived entirely\n  from `tags`, with color always computed via `mapToColorCategory`.\n- Moved `category` and `provider` out of the typed spec and into the\n  schemaless `data` blob (`ProviderMetadataSpecData`), alongside\n  `verification`.\n- Removed the now-unused `type` field; the catalog''s \"Providers\" filter is\n  sourced from `provider` instead.\n- Removed the `ServiceLevel` enum in favor of a plain `string`, since the\n  value is no longer a closed set.\n- Replaced the catalog''s hardcoded Category/Provider filter UI with a\n  dynamic, config-driven filter row: `CatalogComponent` now reads\n  `uiConfig.filters` from the Luigi node context and renders one\n  `<fdp-multi-combobox>` per configured `{label, providerMetadataPath}`\n  entry (no entries configured means no filter row at all).\n\n## Why\nSeveral typed spec fields either duplicated data already carried by the\nschemaless `data` blob or were superseded by simpler representations on\nexisting fields. Consolidating them keeps the model minimal. The catalog''s\nfilters were hardcoded to exactly Category and Provider; making them\nconfig-driven lets the set of filters change without a UI code change.\n\n## Details\n- Added `services/catalog-filters.utils.ts`: a generic dot-path resolver\n  (`getByPath`) that transparently parses JSON-encoded sub-objects such as\n  `spec.data`, plus `getFilterOptions`/`matches` helpers. This replaces the\n  now-deleted `categories.utils.ts` and `providers.utils.ts`.\n- `CatalogDataItem` gained `providerMetadata` (the object filter paths\n  resolve against) and dropped the now-dead `category`/`type` fields.\n- `ProviderService` gained `getCategory`/`getProvider`/`getMainLink`\n  accessors that parse the `data` blob, mirroring the existing\n  `getVerification` pattern.\n- Updated the `getMarketplaceEntriesQuery` GraphQL query to match the model\n  changes (dropped `category`, `type`, `labels { ... }`, `mainLink { ... }`;\n  added `tags`, `links { ... main }`).\n- Updated and added tests across services, components, and state effects to\n  match; full suite passes with `tsc --noEmit`, `ng test`, and `ng build`\n  clean after each change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6227adc4835ca36c398a49927306c933f3516fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/trees/e6227adc4835ca36c398a49927306c933f3516fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/commits/5de352a7015f5a572b878b3e15bb2b2244708842","verification":{"payload":"tree e6227adc4835ca36c398a49927306c933f3516fa\nparent 3a4b44df9485472660e021f6a93f2bd687f8ed1b\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1789630657 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789630657 +0200\n\nfeat: simplify provider metadata model and make catalog filters dynamic (#202)\n\n* Adjust verification info\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor: simplify provider metadata model and make catalog filters dynamic\n\n## What changed\n- Folded the standalone `mainLink` field into `links[]`: a link is now marked\n  as the main one via `links[].main` instead of a separate field.\n- Removed the raw `labels` field; provider chips are now derived entirely\n  from `tags`, with color always computed via `mapToColorCategory`.\n- Moved `category` and `provider` out of the typed spec and into the\n  schemaless `data` blob (`ProviderMetadataSpecData`), alongside\n  `verification`.\n- Removed the now-unused `type` field; the catalog''s \"Providers\" filter is\n  sourced from `provider` instead.\n- Removed the `ServiceLevel` enum in favor of a plain `string`, since the\n  value is no longer a closed set.\n- Replaced the catalog''s hardcoded Category/Provider filter UI with a\n  dynamic, config-driven filter row: `CatalogComponent` now reads\n  `uiConfig.filters` from the Luigi node context and renders one\n  `<fdp-multi-combobox>` per configured `{label, providerMetadataPath}`\n  entry (no entries configured means no filter row at all).\n\n## Why\nSeveral typed spec fields either duplicated data already carried by the\nschemaless `data` blob or were superseded by simpler representations on\nexisting fields. Consolidating them keeps the model minimal. The catalog''s\nfilters were hardcoded to exactly Category and Provider; making them\nconfig-driven lets the set of filters change without a UI code change.\n\n## Details\n- Added `services/catalog-filters.utils.ts`: a generic dot-path resolver\n  (`getByPath`) that transparently parses JSON-encoded sub-objects such as\n  `spec.data`, plus `getFilterOptions`/`matches` helpers. This replaces the\n  now-deleted `categories.utils.ts` and `providers.utils.ts`.\n- `CatalogDataItem` gained `providerMetadata` (the object filter paths\n  resolve against) and dropped the now-dead `category`/`type` fields.\n- `ProviderService` gained `getCategory`/`getProvider`/`getMainLink`\n  accessors that parse the `data` blob, mirroring the existing\n  `getVerification` pattern.\n- Updated the `getMarketplaceEntriesQuery` GraphQL query to match the model\n  changes (dropped `category`, `type`, `labels { ... }`, `mainLink { ... }`;\n  added `tags`, `links { ... main }`).\n- Updated and added tests across services, components, and state effects to\n  match; full suite passes with `tsc --noEmit`, `ng test`, and `ng build`\n  clean after each change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>