/mocker; both are bumped together\n  because @vitest/coverage-v8 pins its vitest peer to the exact same version\n\nVerified: npm audit reports 0 vulnerabilities; build and tests (208) pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24e5034ad7919861fed0040e0e91173e2b9c2d8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/trees/24e5034ad7919861fed0040e0e91173e2b9c2d8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/commits/3a4b44df9485472660e021f6a93f2bd687f8ed1b","verification":{"payload":"tree 24e5034ad7919861fed0040e0e91173e2b9c2d8a\nparent 38931aa7162542d285671a2ed915f21497f1f1cc\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1789564966 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789564966 +0400\n\nfix(deps): bump vitest to resolve GHSA-82fw-gwwq-j7x9 (#203)\n\nDependency bumps:\n- vitest and @vitest/coverage-v8 4.1.10 → 4.1.11, which resolves\n  GHSA-82fw-gwwq-j7x9 in vitest and @vitest/mocker; both are bumped together\n  because @vitest/coverage-v8 pins its vitest peer to the exact same version\n\nVerified: npm audit reports 0 vulnerabilities; build and tests (208) pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqpgmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7ggQAKkgXQhh4udG6wf+W90wVvI8\nEF/gzGOXRjT7GFUBf8bfVUoaSLrbF5wT8Ezk7i8tRDvJ3lQrNBH4Yf8EA2CGBSbE\nJAho5WFImy/ZikMPtfxJBvwoKTJwrLQqtmczjrLOpOQAiEFasyo4CyzS8Pla7RQ5\nGGZdEJjXr7o4Trjpj67MMhMWS/Mc9PLNpMKjXhEgXh51kRGtL32U23ZzUBg0xOfm\nEkdc4rvqTLdeRntNz92MFiG/8O3rbnVAygsBRnF/vDejf9KhzRdYszMIyoQJdVJJ\ns69A8DBWBGDongLfVnqy6okZJr1O1ej2YkyuQ9zLf4mRyl1cn+Shj2AMp5Lh6ulz\nsax1tg8dQMDYMX8qXb8QMOtGI5kDaCn8FVM1sYqw7W7UVJ+5u+Bmo+CIsChUKzm1\n6fAi1o/9lGzjq7HJ0WHPcbKnaYNY2iWu/3Y1sHSatashG5/4E2ABYhtD2iI5y6em\nTL7286ZmfVbthVxGI6PN+dFVa3RXuf++8tUX7qXUMJi+29HgVyXbJNywoSdne8Tn\n0ETQjRm/iI/+q+eixpG