b.com/users/gkrajniak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gkrajniak","id":7794387,"login":"gkrajniak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQzODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/commits/38931aa7162542d285671a2ed915f21497f1f1cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T09:45:45Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T09:45:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: migrate to angular 22 (#200)\n\n* feat: migrate to Angular 22 and modernize to signals + inject()\n\n## Framework upgrade\n\nUpgrade Angular 21.2.20 -> 22.1.6 (core, CLI, build, compiler-cli) via\n`ng update`, along with the third-party peers that gate Angular 22:\n\n- @angular/cdk 21 -> 22.1.6\n- @ngrx/* 21 -> 22.0.1\n- @fundamental-ngx/* 0.61 -> 0.64.3 (+ fundamental-styles 0.41.8,\n  @sap-theming/theming-base-content 11.36)\n- apollo-angular 13 -> 14, @apollo/client -> 4.2.12\n- @luigi-project/client-support-angular 21 -> 22.1\n- angular-eslint 21 -> 22.5, typescript-eslint -> 8.70,\n  @openmfp/eslint-config-typescript -> 0.7.14, @eslint/js pinned 9.39.5\n- typescript 5.9 -> 6.0.3\n\n## Migration fixes\n\n- Add `ignoreDeprecations: \"6.0\"` to tsconfig for TS 6.0''s `baseUrl` deprecation.\n- PmLuigiContextService: `contextSignal` is now a property (Signal) in\n  client-support-angular v22, not a method — override it as a readonly property.\n\n## Modernization\n\n- Convert component inputs to signal `input()` / `input.required()`\n  (catalog-item, empty-catalog, catalog) and outputs to `output()`.\n- Convert constructor DI to `inject()` across services, effects, and components\n  via `@angular/core:inject` schematic.\n- Update affected specs to set signal inputs via `componentRef.setInput()` and\n  build inject()-based services/effects through TestBed.\n\ncatalog.component''s `data` and `infoLabelFilters` remain decorator @Inputs:\n`data` is watched in ngOnChanges and `infoLabelFilters` is reassigned\ninternally, so signal inputs (read-only) don''t apply without a behavioral\nrefactor.\n\n## Verification\n\nBuild passes; all 208 unit tests pass; migration files are prettier-clean.\nRuntime smoke test (standalone catalog render) confirms Fundamental-ngx 0.64\nand the apollo runtime work on Angular 22.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix iscons\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b454ec2bc69463d7a98f4e201b168476c945cfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/trees/3b454ec2bc69463d7a98f4e201b168476c945cfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/commits/38931aa7162542d285671a2ed915f21497f1f1cc","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b454ec2bc69463d7a98f4e201b168476c945cfe\nparent 21f0d369c456fb65990d0119bd25768d32f10dca\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1789379145 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789379145 +0400\n\nfeat: migrate to angular 22 (#200)\n\n* feat: migrate to Angular 22 and modernize to signals + inject()\n\n## Framework upgrade\n\nUpgrade Angular 21.2.20 -> 22.1.6 (core, CLI, build, compiler-cli) via\n`ng update`, along with the third-party peers that gate Angular 22:\n\n- @angular/cdk 21 -> 22.1.6\n- @ngrx/* 21 -> 22.0.1\n- @fundamental-ngx/* 0.61 -> 0.64.3 (+ fundamental-styles 0.41.8,\n  @sap-theming/theming-base-content 11.36)\n- apollo-angular 13 -> 14, @apollo/client -> 4.2.12\n- @luigi-project/client-support-angular 21 -> 22.1\n- angular-eslint 21 -> 22.5, typescript-eslint -> 8.70,\n  @openmfp/eslint-config-typescript -> 0.7.14, @eslint/js pinned 9.39.5\n- typescript 5.9 -> 6.0.3\n\n## Migration fixes\n\n- Add `ignoreDeprecations: \"6.0\"` to tsconfig for TS 6.0''s `baseUrl` deprecation.\n- PmLuigiContextService: `contextSignal` is now a property (Signal) in\n  client-support-angular v22, not a method — override it as a readonly property.\n\n## Modernization\n\n- Convert component inputs to signal `input()` / `input.required()`\n  (catalog-item, empty-catalog, catalog) and outputs to `output()`.\n- Convert constructor DI to `inject()` across services, effects, and components\n  via `@angular/core:inject` schematic.\n- Update affected specs to set signal inputs via `componentRef.setInput()` and\n  build inject()-based services/effects through TestBed.\n\ncatalog.component''s `data` and `infoLabelFilters` remain decorator @Inputs:\n`data` is watched in ngOnChanges and `infoLabelFilters` is reassigned\ninternally, so signal inputs (read-only) don''t apply without a behavioral\nrefactor.\n\n## Verification\n\nBuild passes; all 208 unit tests pass; migration files are prettier-clean.\nRuntime smoke test (standalone catalog render) confirms Fundamental-ngx 0.64\nand the apollo runtime work on Angular 22.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix iscons\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqp8JJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9+0QACJyN1CccpnHLrASaNBieeeK\nFjZxACwBqBgqCip/yZwj2+oDLKWV4pgD3FJt2UoEB7oJJST2j4rBp+qt6phtn7a9\nNHH3tVgj+hjfFPOIxGOhZw2MKQ+rWQhYYsR7AMTStx9So6calONHGPIwo/44D1kS\nmxUsqeWeBOTkbYqpBaSe265/ab/pJ