3fd439ad574764b46edaa84f33026954de9207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/trees/bf3fd439ad574764b46edaa84f33026954de9207"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/commits/cfad74df812db41048498603d427de7b237035ec","verification":{"payload":"tree bf3fd439ad574764b46edaa84f33026954de9207\nparent 90b8c2d48a3fdad6076525aeebc6d57e2d8fc521\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1789112004 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789112004 +0200\n\nfeat: add provider verification badge (#198)\n\n* feat: add provider verification badge\n\nShow a verification badge on marketplace provider cards and the provider\ndetail dialog, driven by the optional `verification` metadata on a\nprovider (`{ label, status, icon?, hint? }`).\n\nThe badge is rendered with a single Fundamental `fd-object-status`, which\ncarries the label, the status color, and an SAP-icons glyph together. The\nglyph comes from `verification.icon` and falls back to `verified` when the\ndata omits it; the optional `hint` is surfaced via inline help. Providers\nwithout `verification` metadata render no badge.\n\nAlso adds a sample marketplace response\n(`verification-info.mock.json`) next to the component covering the\nvariants: certified (explicit icon), verified (default icon), partner\n(critical status), community (neutral), and an unverified provider with no\nbadge.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* fix tests\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* fix tests\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* fix tests\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* Set the default style for the verification info as `informative`\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo67ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8kcQACiEYaLkMwQu81848JiCP6xj\nUzB6KQQix6WOeNJMKbPZ2