n empty, conflicting, or malformed\nselectors instead of broadening them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\n\n* fix: remove unused selector typename fields\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5ade2eb1cf04c1dc636a26432ee01597d4ade2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/trees/e5ade2eb1cf04c1dc636a26432ee01597d4ade2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/commits/90b8c2d48a3fdad6076525aeebc6d57e2d8fc521","verification":{"payload":"tree e5ade2eb1cf04c1dc636a26432ee01597d4ade2d\nparent b3371500ff94fa1010dda6a19ef17f4c54300364\nauthor Theodor Ganescu <anastazya@users.noreply.github.com> 1788253780 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788253780 +0200\n\nfix: copy exact permission claims into the APIBinding on enable (#192)\n\n* fix: copy exact permission claims into the APIBinding on enable\n\nThe enable composition fabricated verbs: [''*''] and selector matchAll for\nevery claim; now it copies the export''s verbs and defaultSelector into\nthe accepted claim and fails closed on empty, conflicting, or malformed\nselectors instead of broadening them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\n\n* fix: remove unused selector typename fields\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Theodor Ganescu <star.sg1@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlpZUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9EMQABG4ZLYG9lpRHF13i9rT1EEu\nWcYSBRq0BY2pnpDBQiMh5tG2wVOaO6iIyz1X48Ik5V+htdy