 Marinov <brsmnv@proton.me>\n\n* Update URLs to unblock schema fetching\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <b.marinov@sap.com>\nSigned-off-by: Boris Marinov <brsmnv@proton.me>\n\n* Fetch marketplace schema\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP <b.marinov@sap.com>\nSigned-off-by: Boris Marinov <brsmnv@proton.me>\n\n* fix tests\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* fix merge\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* revert to v1alpha1\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* fix tests\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Boris Marinov <brsmnv@proton.me>\nCo-authored-by: Boris Marinov <brsmnv@proton.me>","tree":{"sha":"e938ab86881252d998d3e59b97e58146562fe9f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/trees/e938ab86881252d998d3e59b97e58146562fe9f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/commits/a46674e09b400ac5027d5681904d2f658ee5e340","verification":{"payload":"tree e938ab86881252d998d3e59b97e58146562fe9f8\nparent 1b8baf1a0efda6b21274c64294c303ca04310db4\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1787818093 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787818093 +0400\n\nfeat: migrate marketplace API from v1alpha1 to v1alpha2 (#187)\n\n* feat: migrate marketplace API from v1alpha1 to v1alpha2\n\nPoint all marketplace_platform_mesh_io GraphQL operations at the\nv1alpha2 API group. Other API groups (apis_kcp_io, tenancy_kcp_io,\netc.) are left on v1alpha1 as they still only expose that version.\n\n- queries: nest MarketplaceEntries under v1alpha2\n- graphql.service: read response path from v1alpha2\n- graphql.service.spec: update mock response shape to v1alpha2\n- schema.graphql: rename the marketplace query/mutation/subscription\n  entries to v1alpha2 (hand-edit; regenerated on next fetch-schemas run)\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>\n\n* adjust the model\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <g