81)\n\nClears all 29 npm audit findings (1 critical, 24 high, 1 moderate, 3 low),\nmostly transitive `undici`, `vite`, `esbuild`, and `piscina` advisories plus\n`@angular/common`/`@angular/compiler` framework advisories.\n\n- Bump the Angular 21.2.x set to the latest patch via `ng update`\n  (`@angular/*` framework 21.2.8 -> 21.2.20, `@angular/build`/`@angular/cli`\n  21.2.7 -> 21.2.21) — all within the same 21.2 minor.\n- `npm audit fix` for the remaining transitive lockfile bumps.\n\n`npm audit` now reports 0 vulnerabilities. Build and the full test suite\n(210 tests) pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bb8de487f37e411f360185035eff2fc8a3e6208","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/trees/3bb8de487f37e411f360185035eff2fc8a3e6208"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/marketplace-ui/git/commits/c812e4aa529c4e19eeee841d03e8cd8488408afd","verification":{"payload":"tree 3bb8de487f37e411f360185035eff2fc8a3e6208\nparent f738985397522f95c51cbb2c4f9401ac2e86176a\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1786608889 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786608889 +0400\n\nfix(deps): resolve npm audit vulnerabilities (#181)\n\nClears all 29 npm audit findings (1 critical, 24 high, 1 moderate, 3 low),\nmostly transitive `undici`, `vite`, `esbuild`, and `piscina` advisories plus\n`@angular/common`/`@angular/compiler` framework advisories.\n\n- Bump the Angular 21.2.x set to the latest patch via `ng update`\n  (`@angular/*` framework 21.2.8 -> 21.2.20, `@angular/build`/`@angular/cli`\n  21.2.7 -> 21.2.21) — all within the same 21.2 minor.\n- `npm audit fix` for the remaining transitive lockfile bumps.\n\n`npm audit` now reports 0 vulnerabilities. Build and the full test suite\n(210 tests) pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfXz5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAE3EQABJu7+ZjTSZ59Sq3URWOL1nK\nojUVmsooPPjXTHG