:01Z","email":"felipe.leon@instructure.com","name":"Felipe Leon"},"message":"Edit modal for all types of module items\n\nEdit modal works for all module items types.\nModule item title is shown correctly for External Tool Types.\n\nTest plan:\n\n1. Create a course and a Module.\n2. For this module create at least one item of each type:\n   (assignment, wiki page, discussion, external url, header\n   file, quizz (new and old version) and externall tool)\n3. For at least one module item of each type repeat these steps:\n   1. Go to action module and click on \"Edit\" option.\n\tVerify:\n\t\tEdit Item Details is shown.\n\t\tTitle and Indent have the right value.\n\t\tFor External Tool and External URL the URL field\n\t\tis shown and has the right value.\n   2. Change the values in the form and Click Update.\n\tVerify:\n\t\tThe values are changed in the module item correctly.\n\n4. In Module Item list verify that the Title shown for External Tool\n   Items is shown correctly.\n5. Verify that all module titles are shown correctly in Student View.\n\nCloses: LX-2875, LX-2925\nflag=modules_page_rewrite\n\nChange-Id: I07154bf59bfb5bdad70fb8295b55141f24d4d304\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/383988\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Drake Harper <drake.harper@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Drake Harper <drake.harper@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Drake Harper <drake.harper@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e02b5acf52b20a34a3ef42bcd6fc4834541eef5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/trees/3e02b5acf52b20a34a3ef42bcd6fc4834541eef5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/commits/61b66cf671bed4ad31c54c54e02c934853651047","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201780020?v=4","events_url":"https://api.git