as-infrastructure/commits/334ce60b6b943fcf9b25dfcdfc50f865c30d1b16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44081464?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/csuzdy","id":44081464,"login":"csuzdy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDgxNDY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csuzdy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commits/f577af534cf489020d36d08df81493259899e9cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-11T10:18:27Z","email":"csaba.csuzdi@instructure.com","name":"Csaba Csuzdi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-23T14:34:25Z","email":"csaba.csuzdi@instructure.com","name":"Csaba Csuzdi"},"message":"Add Asset Processor results to Student Grades page\n\ncloses INTEROP-9122\nflag=lti_asset_processor\n\ntest plan:\nScenario 1: Document Processors Column and Cell Integration\n- Create a new course\n- Create an assignment with no asset processors configured\n- Navigate to student grades page as student\n- Verify no \"Document Processors\" column header is visible\n- Attach an asset processor to the assignment\n- Refresh grades page and verify column still not visible\n  (no submissions with asset_reports yet)\n- Submit a file to the assignment\n  (this creates submission but no asset_reports yet)\n- Verify column still not visible until asset processor\n  creates asset_reports\n- Ensure asset processor creates asset_reports for the\n  submission\n- Refresh grades page and verify \"Document Processors\"\n  column appears with proper header\n- Verify AssetProcessorCell component renders with\n  appropriate status:\n  * asset_reports with priority = 0 -> \"All good\"\n  * asset_reports with priority > 0 -> \"Needs attention\"\n  * asset_reports with not Processed progress -> \"No results\"\n  * asset_reports with visibleToOwner = false -> empty cell\n- Add another assignment without asset processor and verify\n  column remains visible but cell is empty\n\nScenario 2: Legacy vs New Grade Summary Behavior\n- Enable student_grade_summary_upgrade feature flag\n- Repeat all steps from Scenario 1\n\nScenario 3: restrict_quantitative_data FF\n- Enable restrict_quantitative_data FF on the root account\n- enable it on the course as well:\n```\n  c.restrict_quantitative_data = true\n  c.save!\n```\n- add multiple assignments to the course\n- submit to the assignments with the test user\n- grade the assignments with admin\n- check the gradebook page with the test user\n\nChange-Id: If41210caae95960e452320743afa606fa4de3b39\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/383533\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: David Varga <d.varga@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: David Varga <d.varga@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Scott Morgan <scott.morgan@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b3955ec12b68c354e28b332102533d9e322279d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/trees/0b3955ec12b68c354e28b332102533d9e322279d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/commits/f577af534cf489020d36d08df81493259899e9cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44081464?v=4