 Ags Scores create endpoint\nfrom time to time there were 422 errors\nIt turned out that because of a race condition\nwhen multiple requests updated the same Lti:Result\nrecord simultaneously an invalid state\nscore_given=present score_maximum=nil could be\npresisted into the DB.\n\nfixes: INTEROP-9302\nflag=none\n\ntest-plan:\n- specs run\n- Create a record with score_given present but\nscore_maximum null\n- Hit scores controller create endpoint\n(via Lti 1.3 Test tool)\n- Make sure request got processed\n and return 200 not 422\n\nChange-Id: I0e8a6ee677557caaacc276038c82c0a11ab35b93\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/384083\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Evan Battaglia <ebattaglia@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Evan Battaglia <ebattaglia@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: David Varga <d.varga@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ea080f2a0b0461b205daeca172996228c21eb21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/trees/9ea080f2a0b0461b205daeca172996228c21eb21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/commits/2d444a1c1481aa0666d0a0c62ba81e023d119e3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24938738?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davefej/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davefej/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davefej/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davefej/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davefej","id":24938738,"login":"davefej","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0OTM4NzM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davefej/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davefej/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davefej/repos","site_admin":f