te":"2025-07-21T19:44:42Z","email":"felipe.leon@instructure.com","name":"Felipe Leon"},"message":"Apply set values for copied course start and end dates\n\nThe copy course new start and end dates are not syncing up\nwith the adjust dates start and end dates.\n\nTest plan:\n1. Create a course and go to settings page.\n2. Set participation to Course.\n3. Edit Start and End Date.\n4. Go to Copy this course section.\n5. Check \"Adjust events and due dates\"\n   Verify:\n\tBegining and end date old dates and new dates are showint the\n\tsame value in the start and end dates shown in the main form.\n6. Change Start and End dates values in main form.\n   Verify:\n\tBegining and Ending date shown in shift dates form are updated\n\tand show the value set in the fields in the main form.\n7. Change Begining and Ending date in shift dates form.\n   Verify:\n\tStart and End dates in main form are updated and show the values\n\tset in the shift dates form.\n8. Create the copy of the course.\n   Verify:\n\tStart and End dates shown in settings page are the same set in the\n\tcopy course form.\n\nflag=none\nCloses: LX-2602\nChange-Id: I73c654303f45022fc2324d8b26b8744ed432d69c\n\nChange-Id: Ia86194c1a52ec366cbfdfc92e9a9b96a7e102cf9\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/383070\nReviewed-by: Jaime Lozano <jaime.lozano@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Jaime Lozano <jaime.lozano@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Felipe Leon <felipe.leon@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b5de2fe893c8454c331ed665623bcaa0ec94263","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/trees/2b5de2fe893c8454c331ed665623bcaa0ec94263"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/commits/e9ecce6081dfbb85aecee890029d98da3b7b0d81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gith