they have different\n    timestamps\n  - Complete each checkpoint for the discussion. Wait at least\n    1 minute in between each reply so each reply has a different\n    timestamp\n- Act as the teacher:\n  - View the assignment in SpeedGrader and observe the\n    Submission to view picker displays the correct timestamps\n    and not just the latest one for all options\n  - View the checkpointed discussion in SpeedGrader and switch\n    to an in-context view. Navigate through each reply and\n    observe the submitted at timestamp changes on the right\n    as you navigate the replies on the left.\n\nChange-Id: I36244a6d500504b7b27935d0fa30909eceee32ac\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/384347\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Kyle Rosenbaum <krosenbaum@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Szvetlin Tanyi <szvetlin.tanyi@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Szvetlin Tanyi <szvetlin.tanyi@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7f1eb177ee32c8d79fb5777c395cd34448b2644","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/trees/b7f1eb177ee32c8d79fb5777c395cd34448b2644"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/commits/be4bdb40109a5bcb33e7ca59c48ae7da551add72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33700893?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/angelagomba","id":33700893,"login":"angelagomba","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzAwODkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commit/be4bdb40109a5bcb33e7ca59c48ae7da551add72","node_id":"C_kwDOPSThX9oAKGJlNGJkYjQwMTA5YTViY2IzM2U3Y2E1OWM0OGFlN2RhNTUxYWRkNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commit/dc3a3df1686025a9c3e6bddc944e211c8de72adf","sha":"dc3a3df1686025a9c3e6bddc944e211c8de72adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commits/dc3a3df1686025a9c3e6bddc944e211c8de72adf"}],"sha":"be4bdb40109a5bcb33e7ca59c48ae7da551add72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commits/be4bdb40109a5bcb33e7ca59c48ae7da551add72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108301393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarah-gerard","id":108301393,"login":"sarah-gerard","node_id":"U_kgDOBnSMUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarah-gerard","user_view_ty