s://github.com/subpardaemon","id":897864,"login":"subpardaemon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5Nzg2NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/subpardaemon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/subpardaemon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/subpardaemon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/subpardaemon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/subpardaemon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/subpardaemon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commits/ff679ec9c6300444144e30d82a512107a9a7184a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-15T15:20:39Z","email":"akemeny@instructure.com","name":"akemeny"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-21T14:45:29Z","email":"akemeny@instructure.com","name":"Andras Kemeny"},"message":"Fix verification for course syllabi and TOS\n\nflag = file_association_access\n\nTest plan:\n1. Turn on FF, create a course, and create a syllabus. Add a course file\n   and insert it in the syllabus. (You need to also enable\n   disable_file_verifiers_in_public_syllabus!)\n2. In the course settings, set syllabus visibility to public.\n3. Open an incognito window, and navigate to the syllabus of the course.\n4. The inserted image should show.\n5. In the account settings, change the Acceptance Use Policy to custom.\n6. Create a user file and add it to the AUP text, and save.\n7. In the incognito browser, on the login screen, the AUP should show\n   with the inserted image.\n\nrefs GROW-100\nrefs GROW-104\n\nChange-Id: I7377869b049f51088fac5478afd17deb6a8e5559\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/383845\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Kasra Rismanchi <kasra.rismanchi@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Kasra Rismanchi <kasra.rismanchi@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Andr