eter Popovics <peter.popovics@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"39c7846c9f58c8291bd90891eeb34c5875e78c12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/trees/39c7846c9f58c8291bd90891eeb34c5875e78c12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/commits/9bed2eb5a2feae59a6b8550b47b4d22affae58a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270969563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/peterpopovics-instructure","id":270969563,"login":"peterpopovics-instructure","node_id":"U_kgDOECaq2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peterpopovics-instructure","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commit/9bed2eb5a2feae59a6b8550b47b4d22affae58a3","node_id":"C_kwDOPSThX9oAKDliZWQyZWI1YTJmZWFlNTlhNmI4NTUwYjQ3YjRkMjJhZmZhZTU4YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commit/17fb5c040d66308f37789ab5649d8a2e19764c48","sha":"17fb5c040d66308f37789ab5649d8a2e19764c48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commits/17fb5c040d66308f37789ab5649d8a2e19764c48"}],"sha":"9bed2eb5a2feae59a6b8550b47b4d22affae58a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commits/9bed2eb5a2feae59a6b8550b47b4d22affae58a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20050280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xandroxygen","id":20050280,"login":"xandroxygen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDUwMjgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xandroxygen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commits/17fb5c040d66308f37789ab5649d8a2e19764c48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-16T20:26:39Z","email":"xmoffatt@instructure.com","name":"Xander Moffatt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-18T17:04:58Z","email":"xmoffatt@instructure.com","name":"Xander Moffatt"},"message":"allow student view to launch nested LTI tools\n\nwhy:\n* launching an LTI tool from within another LTI tool\n(namely, New Quizzes) requires some special help from\ncanvas to validate the in-between tool''s domain\nand make the launch work correctly\n* the checks before adding this parent_frame_context\nwere not accounting for the student view\n* which resulted in the student view not being able to launch\nLTI tools like Studio from within New Quizzes\n\ncloses INTEROP-9423\ncloses QUIZ-15803\nflag=none\n\ntest plan:\n* install an LTI tool A- this one will be the nested/inner tool\n* install another LTI tool B, 1.3 is easiest - this one will be the\ntrusted/in-between tool like NQ\n* make sure both tools are deployed and note the ids\nof the ContextExternalTools created for each one\n* change internal_service to true on the trusted tool B''s developer key\n* launch the inner tool Awith the parent frame context of the\ntrusted one (this is easier than setting up NQ locally) by going\nto this url with your domain/ids subbed:\n`http://canvas.docker/courses/1/external_tools/<A.id>/\nresource_selection?parent_frame_context=<B.id>&editor=1`\n* view the network tab as the launch occurs and confirm that\nany request to canvas, like the initial /resource_selection,\nhas tool B''s domain in the Content Security Policy header\n* without this commit, click the View as Student button in the course\n* and hit that launch url again. the CSP header will not have\ntool B''s domain in it - this is what causes Studio not to launch\nin NQ\n* check out this commit and hit that launch url again, still in\nStudent View. the CSP header should have tool B''s domain\nin it now\n\nChange-Id: I83ece9e4870d2152e14a9866af975068bc44ab5c\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/384008\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nReviewed-by: Paul Gray <paul.gray@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Paul Gray <paul.gray@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Xander Moffatt <xmoffatt@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa8b052188e98d1d77bf994f85486ac9318d1257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/trees/aa8b052188e98d1d77bf994f85486ac9318d1257"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/commits/17fb5c040d66308f37789ab5649d8a2e19764c48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsign