elagomba","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNzAwODkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angelagomba","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commits/0c9eb3a62f633672c825c9a27056cfe0812a7ecd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-14T15:22:29Z","email":"angela.gomba@instructure.com","name":"Angela Gomba"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-18T16:56:16Z","email":"angela.gomba@instructure.com","name":"Angela Gomba"},"message":"Diff Tag CSV import\n\ncloses EGG-853 EGG-1294\nflag=assign_to_differentiation_tags\n\nTest Plan:\n- Create a CSV using the format specified in the docs:\n  /doc/api/file.differentiation_tags_csv.html\n  - To generate the docs, run bundle exec rake doc:api\n- Test the following cases:\n  - Creating tags with memberships\n  - Adding a tag (with membership) to existing tag set\n  - Moving a tag (with membership) to a different tag set\n  - Upload incorrectly formatted CSV and observe error\n\nChange-Id: Ib861772c3990245c73a9b5d55a2dcaeeb5876329\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instructure.com/c/canvas-lms/+/383742\nReviewed-by: Martin Yosifov <martin.yosifov@instructure.com>\nTested-by: Service Cloud Jenkins <svc.cloudjenkins@instructure.com>\nQA-Review: Chawn Neal <chawn.neal@instructure.com>\nMigration-Review: Isaac Moore <isaac.moore@instructure.com>\nProduct-Review: Sam Garza <sam.garza@instructure.com>","tree":{"sha":"3efb44cf0085a15f674dd43be058875fc99e6675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/git/trees/3efb44cf0085a15f674dd43be058875fc99e6675"},"ur