{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abence","id":553442,"login":"abence","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abence","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aianta/odo-canvas-infrastructure/commits/83c7fe6ab7e4bb786206e02806cf1ec74498c79d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-17T11:09:49Z","email":"bence.arpasi@instructure.com","name":"Bence Arpasi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-18T14:38:03Z","email":"bence.arpasi@instructure.com","name":"Bence Árpási"},"message":"Fix \"Needs Grading\" indicator for non-final activity progress\n\nThe fix ensures that SpeedGrader''s \"Needs Grading\" indicator only\nappears when students have actually completed their work in the LTI\ntool, preventing confusion for instructors and maintaining proper\ngrading workflow.\n\nThe indicator should only appear when activityProgress is \"Submitted\"\nor \"Completed\" to indicate that the student has actually submitted\ntheir work and it''s ready for manual review.\n\ncloses INTEROP-9392\n\nflag=none\n\ntest plan\n\n- Create an LTI assignment\n- Submit score via AGS API with:\n\"activityProgress\" : \"Started\",\n\"gradingProgress\": \"PendingManual\",\nExpected: SpeedGrader should NOT show black \"Needs Grading\" dot\n\nChange-Id: I722fd73b06ff3278d67b202a9be6d32c2b683726\nReviewed-on: https://gerrit.instruct