vices and Infrastructure as CodeUniversal Components: Built reusable core components (payments engine, customer management, analytics dashboard) shared across all verticalsKey differentiators:Multi-tenant architecture supporting different business modelsReal-time analytics and ML-powered insightsNative QR self-service without third-party dependenciesIntelligent split billing and customer journey trackingModular plugin system for vertical-specific featuresInfrastructure improvements:Docker containerization with Kubernetes manifestsCI/CD pipelines with GitHub ActionsComprehensive testing strategy (integration, e2e, performance, security)Monitoring and observability stack (Prometheus, Grafana, ELK)Documentation optimization:Removed emoji/icon tokens for improved LLM processing efficiencyUpdated Continue.dev configuration with Llama3.1 for business analysisEnhanced architectural documentation with AEDD methodologyThis represents a complete platform repositioning from a single-vertical restaurant system to an enterprise-grade multi-vertical POS solution ready for commercial deployment.","tree":{"sha":"b8114f30e26c203640266270c6ee5cbe7367c10c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosvart/intellicore-pos/git/trees/b8114f30e26c203640266270c6ee5cbe7367c10c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegosvart/intellicore-pos/git/commits/0751a99690f8d0f9265efa8453a695bc282b1c83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11177695?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegosvart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegosvart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegosvart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegosvart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/diegosvart","id":11177695,"login":"diegosvart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTc3Njk1","orga